{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/8f1d7bdf61e74779a64a5d953f0d6a1d.avif?t=1768379740\" width=1386 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your recycling empire from junk! Collect, process, and craft valuable products in a chill, satisfying simulator where garbage becomes gold \u267b\ufe0f .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/1f74d3d62bb1fb3d6217fe84023c2e1b.poster.avif?t=1768379740\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/1f74d3d62bb1fb3d6217fe84023c2e1b.webm?t=1768379740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/1f74d3d62bb1fb3d6217fe84023c2e1b.mp4?t=1768379740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JunkRise is a creative recycling simulator where trash isn't just waste \u2013 it's opportunity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a colorful world full of abandoned scraps, busted electronics, and forgotten treasures. It's your job to gather them, sort them, and turn them into something useful... or profitable \ud83d\udcb0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Build your own recycling factory from scratch \u2013 place machines, connect conveyor belts, and automate your entire workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9a Drive around, collect junk, discover hidden areas, and expand your operation one upgrade at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 As your factory grows, so does your impact. Clean the world, one crushed can at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Collect plastic, metal, electronics, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Build and expand your factory with modular machines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Automate item sorting and processing with conveyors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Craft new products and sell them for profit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Explore and unlock new areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Relaxing, stylized visuals with satisfying mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Zero waste. Just good vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 From junkyard to city life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey doesn't stop at recycling \u2014 expand your empire, buy your own house, and unlock access to your dream factory in the bustling streets of JunkRise. \ud83d\udcb0\ud83c\udf07</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/9d3d67e80fe55e721a8ada8135f33e35.poster.avif?t=1768379740\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/9d3d67e80fe55e721a8ada8135f33e35.webm?t=1768379740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/9d3d67e80fe55e721a8ada8135f33e35.mp4?t=1768379740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca8 Cruise through your junkyard empire in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn trash into treasure as you drive your custom-built vehicle across vibrant landscapes. Whether you're hauling scrap or delivering crafted goods \u2014 the road is yours! \ud83c\udf0d\ud83d\udd27</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 